{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"lane-commercial","type":"group","x":0,"y":-260,"width":7800,"height":580,"color":"2","label":"LANE 1 - COMMERCIAL / MER / CUSTOMER"},
		{"id":"lane-material","type":"group","x":0,"y":560,"width":7800,"height":540,"color":"3","label":"LANE 2 - CREATIVE / FABRIC / TECHNICAL / SOURCING / PURCHASING"},
		{"id":"lane-finance-ai","type":"group","x":0,"y":1840,"width":7800,"height":520,"color":"6","label":"LANE 4 - FINANCE / AI PLATFORM / REPORTING"},
		{"id":"lane-factory","type":"group","x":0,"y":1280,"width":7800,"height":360,"color":"4","label":"LANE 3 - FACTORY / WASH / QC / SHIPPING"},
		{"id":"gap-order-twin","type":"text","text":"WHITE SPACE 5\nPPJ Order Lifecycle Twin\nOne view from customer request to shipment and finance.\n\n![[Pasted image 20260714002848.png]]","x":2480,"y":3000,"width":500,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s01-sales","type":"text","text":"# 1. **Sales Pitch / Market Understanding**\nPurpose: identify opportunity, trend, target price, customer direction.\nCoverage: AI-assisted intelligence\n[[E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3]]\n> Canonical: **MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.2**","x":40,"y":-90,"width":460,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s09-po","type":"text","text":"# 9. PO / Order Confirmation\nConfirm PO, style, quantity, delivery, price and commitment.\nCoverage: workflow automation / historical support\n> **[[MER.PO-Commit]]**\nCanonical: **MER.PO.Commit.v1.1**","x":3445,"y":-90,"width":430,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s03-cpd","type":"text","text":"# 3. Creative Product Design / 3D Visual Library\nPre-costing design reference, image search, sample library.\nCoverage: data repository / search\n> **[[CPD.Datamart.v1.1]]**\nOutput: design/style reference for costing.","x":70,"y":670,"width":430,"height":255,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"gap-intake","type":"text","text":"WHITE SPACE 1\nCustomer Request Intake Agent\nNormalize RFQ, techpack, image, target price, timeline, missing info.","x":40,"y":2370,"width":430,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"gap-evidence","type":"text","text":"WHITE SPACE 2\nQuotation Evidence Pack\nTrace CPD, FD, TD, SEW, consumption and wash assumptions used in quote.","x":1840,"y":2370,"width":470,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s13-planning","type":"text","text":"# 13. Production Planning / Factory Preparation\nOrder readiness, material readiness, line plan, manpower, sewing method.\nCoverage: partial production visibility\n> **[[PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1]]**\nGap: costing assumptions -> production plan bridge.","x":3440,"y":1360,"width":450,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s16-qc","type":"text","text":"# 16. QC / TQM / Traceability\nInspection, defect detection, customer quality, RFID/product ID exploration.\nCoverage: AI inspection PoC / RFID feasibility\n> **[[PPJxQSee.ai]]**\n> **[[PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread]]**\n> ![[Pasted image 20260715140648.png]]","x":5880,"y":1360,"width":450,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s11-purchasing","type":"text","text":"# 11. Purchasing / Allocation / Indent / GDI / Inventory\nTransaction workflow, allocation, indent, GDI, inventory, label processing.\nCoverage: automation / workflow / reporting\n> **[[PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2]]**\n> **[[PUR.GDI Automation]]**\n> **[[PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam]]**\n> **[[PUR.Inventory Report]]**\n> **[[PUR.H&M Label-O Processing]]**","x":4020,"y":650,"width":520,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s17-shipping","type":"text","text":"# 17. Packing / Final Warehouse / Shipping Readiness\nFinished goods, QC pass, packing list, carton, shipping instruction, EXIM handoff.\nCoverage: current gap / indirect support only\nGap: Shipping Readiness Dashboard.","x":6600,"y":1355,"width":450,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s12-grn","type":"text","text":"# 12. Material Receiving / Warehouse / GRN\nReceive goods, GRN, supplier invoice matching, WFX reconciliation.\nCoverage: bot automation / invoice utility\n> **[[ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3]]**\n> **[[PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2]]**","x":5040,"y":670,"width":450,"height":270,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s15-wash","type":"text","text":"# 15. Wash / R&D Wash / Operational Wash\nSampling request/trial/result/approval/history and operational wash output/delay/rework.\nCoverage: workflow portal / operational data\n> **[[WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1]]**\n> **[[PROD.COWASH]]**","x":5080,"y":1340,"width":540,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s19-finance","type":"text","text":"# 19. Finance / Accounting / Reporting / Management Insight\nERP, WFX, DWH, invoice, GRN, costing plan, sales efficiency, profitability.\nCoverage: AI-assisted analytics / automation\n> **[[FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1]]**\n> **[[ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3]]**\n> **[[PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1]]**\n> **[[PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2]]**","x":7200,"y":1960,"width":500,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"gap-shipping","type":"text","text":"WHITE SPACE 3\nShipping Readiness Dashboard\nPO, QC pass, packing, carton, document and invoice readiness.","x":7880,"y":1840,"width":450,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"gap-variance","type":"text","text":"WHITE SPACE 4\nCosting Actual Variance Engine\nCompare quote assumptions vs actual consumption, SEW, wash, production efficiency and rework.","x":6800,"y":2480,"width":500,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s18-exim","type":"text","text":"# 18. EXIM / Shipping Documents / Expense Invoice\nShipping docs, service invoices, department/factory/ledger mapping.\nCoverage: automation utility / EXIM-first processing\n> **[[PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1]]**\n> **[[PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2]]**","x":6420,"y":1990,"width":450,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s14-production","type":"text","text":"# 14. Production Execution / Cut /  Sewing Line\nTrack output, target, downtime, efficiency and operational progress.\nCoverage: IoT / dashboard\n> **[[PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1]]**\n---CUT - AUTOMATION","x":4320,"y":1370,"width":540,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s06-inputs","type":"text","text":"# 6. SEW / Consumption / Denim-only Wash Inputs\nSEW: construction, manpower, SMV/SAM if available.\nConsumption: fabric/trim/yield/wastage.\nWash: denim or wash-required only.\nCoverage: partial / input readiness gap\n> **[[TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1]]**\n> **[[FD.Datamart.v2.2]]**\n> **[[WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1]]**\n> **[[PROD.COWASH]]**","x":2100,"y":610,"width":640,"height":350,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s10-sourcing","type":"text","text":"# 10. Sourcing / Supplier / Material Intelligence\nSupplier, material, sample, search, sourcing history.\nCoverage: LLM chatbot / data search\n> **[[SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3]]**\nBoundary: intelligence, not purchasing transaction.","x":2940,"y":670,"width":450,"height":270,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s04-fd","type":"text","text":"# 4. Fabric \nFabric identity, hanger, QR, fabric visibility and material reference.\n**Coverage: Directus repository / QR**\n> **[[FD.Datamart.v2.2]]**\nOutput: fabric/material reference for costing.","x":785,"y":670,"width":430,"height":255,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s05-td","type":"text","text":"# 5. Technical Knowledge / BOM / Pattern / Construction\nBOM, pattern, measurement, sewing method, technical docs.\nCoverage: knowledge platform / possible RAG\n> **[[TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1]]**\nOutput: technical feasibility for costing.","x":1360,"y":645,"width":480,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s08-quote-review","type":"text","text":"# 8. Quotation Review / Negotiation\nReview target price, margin, assumptions, alternatives, risk.\nCoverage: decision support\n> **[[PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1]]**\n> **[[FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1]]**\nGap: quote approval workflow and assumption versioning.","x":2660,"y":-95,"width":460,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s02-request","type":"text","text":"# 2. Customer Request / RFQ\nInputs: email, RFQ, techpack, sample image, target price, timeline.\nCoverage: partly AI-assisted, mostly manual\n\nGap: intake normalization agent.","x":880,"y":-200,"width":430,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s07-costing","type":"text","text":"# 7. Costing / Quotation\nAgentic costing uses upstream inputs:\nCPD + FD + TD + SEW + Consumption + Denim-only Wash.\nCoverage: LLM-assisted / agentic decision support\n> **[[PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1]]**","x":1820,"y":-105,"width":470,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s20-ai-platform","type":"text","text":"# 20. Cross-Process AI / Platform / Helpdesk Layer\nNot a linear stage. Supports approved search, access, orchestration and IT helpdesk.\n\n**[[PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1]] = app discovery/access**\n**[[PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot]] = controlled conversational orchestration**\n**[[PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot]] = IT support knowledge**\n\nRule: domain owner approves data; AI assists, user approves action.","x":520,"y":1920,"width":1550,"height":270,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5c72ef84bb65aa75","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20260715135638.png","x":-2840,"y":-290,"width":1700,"height":960},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"PPJ End-to-End Process and Automation Coverage\nSales pitching -> shipping -> finance reporting\nHighlighted: automation, LLM support, data repositories, workflow gaps","x":-20,"y":-720,"width":2600,"height":150,"color":"1"}
	],
